<title>USA: Renaissance Cosmetics sets $200 mln 144A snr notes.</title>
<headline>Renaissance Cosmetics sets $200 mln 144A snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Renaissance Cosmetics was priced on Monday in the private placement market, according to sole manager CIBC Wood Gundy Securities Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER RENAISSANCE COSMETICS</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 11.75 PCT  MATURITY 2/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE  8/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD  11.75 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD 544 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PERCENT AT 111.75 U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
